## BlockingApi

### Create a deny rule to block a sender, domain, destination, or prefix
## Create a deny rule to block a sender, domain, destination, or prefix
POST https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/rules
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Delete a deny rule by its numeric ruleId
## Delete a deny rule by its numeric ruleId
DELETE https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/rules/{{ruleId}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### Delist an email address from the spam-filter block lists
## Delist an email address from the spam-filter block lists
POST https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/blocks/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

{
  "email" : "client@domain.com"
}


### List addresses currently flagged by spam-filter block lists
## List addresses currently flagged by spam-filter block lists
GET https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/blocks
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

### List custom deny rules (sender / domain / destination / prefix)
## List custom deny rules (sender / domain / destination / prefix)
GET https://api.mailbaby.net/mail/rules
Accept: application/json
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
